[78.315837, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ envctl preserves CDK ownership without changing shared client conversion \u001b[90m(31.597179ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ legacy tags take precedence over labels and absent metadata stays untagged \u001b[90m(0.22572ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ label ownership includes stack companions but not other branches or prefix stacks \u001b[90m(0.735504ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.995949ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.245028ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.451659ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.396764ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.298643ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 10\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 10\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 1530.967382\u001b[39m\r\n"]
